NOTES ON CONTENT, WHICH THE LICENCE ABOVE DOES NOT OVERRIDE

1. Regulatory requirements. The entries in
   data/requirements/atomised_requirements.json are plain-English restatements
   written for this project, based on the published structure of the instruments
   they cite. They are marked `paraphrase_for_demo`. No text of any standard is
   reproduced here, and nothing in this repository is fit for use in an audit.

2. Third-party models. The system downloads and runs BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5 and
   Xenova/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2 at run time. Those models carry their own
   licences from their publishers; neither is redistributed by this repository.

3. Real source documents. data/corpus/ ships empty and is gitignored. Any
   document placed there remains under whatever licence it arrived with, and
   this licence says nothing about it.
